    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "Local maximum at $\\left(\\frac{2\\pi}{3},\\frac{2\\pi}{3}+\\sqrt3\\right)$; local minimum at $\\left(\\frac{4\\pi}{3},\\frac{4\\pi}{3}-\\sqrt3\\right)$. Point of inflection at $(\\pi,\\pi)$. The sketch passes through $(0,0)$ and $(2\\pi,2\\pi)$.",
